From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:09:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 128/342] meson_canvas: the S905's canvas table under one lock

An entry is written through three DMC registers in turn; meson_hdmi and
meson_vdec both write entries. meson_hdmi uses the module when it loads and
writes the registers itself otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
